# Per-deployment root authorized_keys for the K230 appliance image.
#
# This image uses key-only root login (PermitRootLogin prohibit-password,
# PasswordAuthentication no), so the built image MUST contain at least one key
# here or you will be locked out over SSH.
#
# Copy this file to  rootfs-overlay/root/.ssh/authorized_keys  and replace the
# line below with your own public key(s), one per line. That path is gitignored
# per the public-source policy (tools/check_public_tree.py) so key material
# never enters the public tree.
ssh-ed25519 AAAA...replace-with-your-own-public-key... you@host
